    "body": {
      "en": "### Week 1: Go, Stop, Walk and Run\n\nChildren strengthen safe movement response through go/stop cues, walking paths, running zones, floor spots, music cues, and visual signs. The focus is controlled movement and stopping.\n\n### Week 2: Jump, Hop, Dance, Up and Down\n\nChildren explore body coordination through jumping, hopping, dancing, climbing low safe structures, going up/down, and moving with scarves, mats, and rhythm.\n\n### Week 3: Ball and Beanbag Play\n\nChildren practise rolling, throwing soft objects, catching with support, kicking, passing, waiting, and taking turns with balls and beanbags.\n\n### Week 4: Obstacle Route and Group Play\n\nChildren integrate movement actions through tunnels, hoops, mats, push/pull objects, obstacle routes, simple partner play, group clean-up, and safe transition routines.",
      "zh": "### Week 1: Go, Stop, Walk and Run｜第一周：走、停、走和跑\n\n儿童通过走／停提示、行走路径、跑区、地面标记、音乐提示和视觉标志来强化安全动作反应。重点是受控动作和停下来。\n\n### Week 2: Jump, Hop, Dance, Up and Down｜第二周：跳、单脚跳、舞蹈、向上和向下\n\n儿童通过跳跃、单脚跳、舞蹈、攀爬低矮安全结构、上／下移动以及与丝巾、垫子和节奏一起移动来探索身体协调。\n\n### Week 3: Ball and Beanbag Play｜第三周：球与豆袋游戏\n\n儿童练习滚动、扔软物、在支持下接球、踢、传递、等待，以及与球和豆袋轮流。\n\n### Week 4: Obstacle Route and Group Play｜第四周：障碍路线和集体游戏\n\n儿童通过隧道、呼啦圈、垫子、推／拉物品、障碍路线、简单的搭档游戏、集体收拾和安全过渡常规把动作整合起来。"
    },
